invalid type: string "[Context: Knowledge Graph] Prof. Raju K Gopal is a faculty member in the CSE department. Prof. Raju K Gopal teaches 23CSL30E (Cyber Security), CS1U30B (Computer Networks), CS1U42G (Computer Vision), and CS1U43F (Data Mining). The instructor for 23CSL30E (Cyber Security), CS1U30B (Computer Networks), CS1U42G (Computer Vision), and CS1U43F (Data Mining) is Prof. Raju K Gopal.ÿÿ